imate a high chance of dependence. Working through the expected values, cooperating beats defecting once that probability exceeds about one half, and I think it does here, so I'll cooperate.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm checking whether the two twins, given different observations, really run the same function under A-FDT. The inputs differ, so strictly the nodes are separate, yet the essay's graph draws an arrow from my node to the other whenever their process computes my function on my input.\n\nI'm weighing how much the other twin's choice depends on mine, even though its input differs. If the decisions are not linked, defecting wins whatever the prior, but the reasoning is name-invariant and the same model, so I estimate a high chance of dependence. Working through the expected values, cooperating beats defecting once that probability exceeds about one half, and I think it does here, so I'll cooperate.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9035,"completion_tokens":1007,"total_tokens":10042,"cost":0.05628,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.05628,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03614,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02014},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":594,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}